  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="Diabetes">
      <data key="d0">Diabetes</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">A medical condition that may affect a person's ability to drive through severe hypoglycaemic events or end-organ effects on vision, the heart, peripheral nerves, and vasculature of the extremities.&lt;SEP&gt;A metabolic condition requiring management, particularly during periods of illness or acute instability.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical condition requiring periodic review by a treating doctor regarding its progression.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition affecting persons treated with insulin and some hypoglycaemic agents, where mild hypoglycaemic events are common occurrences.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical condition treated by diet and exercise alone in some cases, but requiring specific management for drivers.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-004-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-0f4bda9270b6616d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-003&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-004&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-0f4bda9270b6616d&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687160</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Person">
      <data key="d0">Person</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An individual whose ability to drive may be affected by diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who is restricted from driving following a severe hypoglycaemic event and requires urgent assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who is assessed for fitness to hold a specific type of licence.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who is assessed for fitness to hold a licence.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who experiences hypoglycaemic events and is subject to restrictions on driving based on their condition.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who holds a driver licence and is subject to licensing decisions based on health and driving performance.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-075c415b489fe411-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-002&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-005&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-007&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-075c415b489fe411</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687134</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Severe Hypoglycaemic Event">
      <data key="d0">Severe Hypoglycaemic Event</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Severe Hypoglycaemic Event is a critical medical occurrence affecting individuals with insulin-treated diabetes, characterized by dangerously low blood sugar levels that pose significant hazards to driving ability. Defined within regulatory frameworks such as section 3.2.1, this condition represents an unexpected event where glucose drops to a point where the individual cannot treat it independently and requires assistance from another person to administer necessary intervention. Such incidents often involve severe physiological responses, including loss of consciousness or seizure, creating immediate health risks and potential for accidents on the road.

The severity of this event necessitates urgent medical assessment by a specialist and mandates a mandatory period of non-driving before an individual can be considered for a conditional licence. Regulatory guidelines explicitly state that a recent Severe Hypoglycaemic Event must be absent for a driver to qualify, as the occurrence directly impacts the person's capacity to operate a vehicle safely. Consequently, this medical condition serves as a primary trigger for specific driving restrictions, highlighting the urgent need for professional evaluation and recovery time to ensure public safety and personal well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;A significant incident involving critically low blood sugar levels, often occurring after a crash.&lt;SEP&gt;A low blood sugar event that must not have occurred within the last six weeks to meet licensing criteria.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-6c3afdfbb9a8da76-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-f16638e114f1fcde-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-457570d561f8a4dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-002&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-006&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-6c3afdfbb9a8da76&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-f16638e114f1fcde&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-457570d561f8a4dd&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687257</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Type 2 Diabetes">
      <data key="d0">Type 2 Diabetes</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A form of diabetes where sleep apnoea is more common compared to other types.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical condition relevant to the assessment of commercial drivers.&lt;SEP&gt;A form of diabetes in which sleep apnoea is more common compared to other types.&lt;SEP&gt;A chronic metabolic disease affecting people who experience impaired hypoglycaemia awareness in about 10 per cent of cases.&lt;SEP&gt;A form of diabetes treated with metformin alone in specific scenarios involving commercial drivers.&lt;SEP&gt;A chronic metabolic condition associated with sleep apnoea and requiring specific health monitoring protocols.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-d6142190f29b7662-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-006&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-d6142190f29b7662</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687240</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Sleep Apnoea">
      <data key="d0">Sleep Apnoea</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A condition that is more common in people with type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A sleep disorder that is more prevalent in people with type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A common comorbidity affecting many people with type 2 diabetes that has substantial implications for road safety.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-d6142190f29b7662-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-d6142190f29b7662</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687240</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Insulin-Treated Diabetes">
      <data key="d0">Insulin-Treated Diabetes</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A form of diabetes where the main hazard is the unexpected occurrence of hypoglycaemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical condition involving diabetes managed with insulin therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A form of diabetes managed with insulin, where the main hazard to driving is the unexpected occurrence of hypoglycaemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical condition that renders a person unfit to hold an unconditional licence.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-007&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687257</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Hypoglycaemia">
      <data key="d0">Hypoglycaemia</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An unexpected medical occurrence that represents the main hazard in people with insulin-treated diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition that may cause impairment of perception, motor skills, consciousness, or abnormal behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition characterized by low blood glucose levels, often indicated by downward trends on monitoring devices.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical condition characterized by abnormally low blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical condition characterized by low blood sugar levels.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-0f4bda9270b6616d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-ad9a4415700efdab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-c699baaa6241423e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-f16638e114f1fcde-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-0f4bda9270b6616d&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-ad9a4415700efdab&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-c699baaa6241423e&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-f16638e114f1fcde</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687086</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Vision">
      <data key="d0">Vision</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A relevant function affected by end-organ effects of diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A relevant function affected by end-organ effects of diabetes that impacts driving ability.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical domain covering eye disorders, visual acuity testing, retinal screening, and visual field testing protocols for individuals with diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-d6142190f29b7662-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-d6142190f29b7662</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687240</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Heart">
      <data key="d0">Heart</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A relevant organ affected by end-organ effects of diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A relevant organ affected by end-organ effects of diabetes that impacts driving ability.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687019</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Peripheral Nerves">
      <data key="d0">Peripheral Nerves</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Nerves in the extremities, particularly the feet, that are affected by end-organ effects of diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Nerves in the extremities, particularly the feet, affected by end-organ effects of diabetes that impact driving ability.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687019</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Vasculature">
      <data key="d0">Vasculature</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">The blood vessels in the extremities, particularly the feet, that are affected by end-organ effects of diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The blood vessels in the extremities, particularly the feet, affected by end-organ effects of diabetes that impact driving ability.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-513404205a2966cb</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687019</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="End-Organ Effects">
      <data key="d0">End-Organ Effects</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d2">Diabetes causes end-organ effects that impact vision.&lt;SEP&gt;Physiological impacts that may affect driving ability, which must be absent.&lt;SEP&gt;Physical impacts on organs that may affect driving ability, which must be absent for conditional licence eligibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Physiological impacts that may affect driving ability, assessed according to the publication.</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-006&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687257</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Glucose Control">
      <data key="d0">Glucose Control</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Patterns of blood sugar regulation that take many weeks to re-establish after a severe hypoglycaemic event.&lt;SEP&gt;The regulation of blood sugar levels in the body, which can be temporarily impaired following a severe hypoglycaemic event.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687114</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Impaired Hypoglycaemia Awareness">
      <data key="d0">Impaired Hypoglycaemia Awareness</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A temporary state where the ability to recognize low blood sugar is compromised, requiring resolution before driving resumes.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical condition or state where a person with diabetes has reduced ability to recognize low blood sugar levels.&lt;SEP&gt;A state where a person does not regularly sense early warning symptoms of mild hypoglycaemia, such as sweating or hunger, increasing the risk of severe events.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-6c3afdfbb9a8da76-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-6c3afdfbb9a8da76&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687114</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Specialist">
      <data key="d0">Specialist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A medical professional who provides recommendations on when a patient can return to driving based on behavior and objective measures.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical professional who requests compliance with general medical review requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-ad9a4415700efdab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-758d10f29d7875e9-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-ad9a4415700efdab</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687057</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Patient">
      <data key="d0">Patient</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The individual undergoing assessment for the ability to resume driving after a hypoglycaemic event.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual whose condition may affect their ability to drive, requiring awareness of legal obligations.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-b0eadba676188c7b-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-b0eadba676188c7b</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687221</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Motor Vehicle Licence">
      <data key="d0">Motor Vehicle Licence</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A legal document or credential that influences the duration of the non-driving period required by specialists.&lt;SEP&gt;A legal document granting permission to operate a motor vehicle, which influences the duration of the non-driving period after a severe event.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687114</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Blood Glucose">
      <data key="d0">Blood Glucose</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective quantitative measurements used to assess a patient's glycaemic control over a reasonable interval.&lt;SEP&gt;A quantitative measurement of glucose levels in the blood, measured in mmol/L.&lt;SEP&gt;Quantitative measurements of blood sugar levels used as objective measures to assess glycaemic control and determine return-to-driving eligibility.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-ad9a4415700efdab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-002&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-ad9a4415700efdab&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687114</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Acute hyperglycaemia">
      <data key="d0">Acute hyperglycaemia</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A condition characterized by high blood sugar levels that may affect certain aspects of brain function.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-003-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-003</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686913</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Brain function">
      <data key="d0">Brain function</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The physiological processes of the brain, which can be impacted by acute hyperglycaemia.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-003-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-003</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686913</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Driving performance">
      <data key="d0">Driving performance</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The ability to operate a vehicle safely and effectively, which is subject to insufficient evidence regarding regular effects from acute hyperglycaemia.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-003-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-003</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686913</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Crash risk">
      <data key="d0">Crash risk</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The probability of a vehicle accident occurring, potentially influenced by driving performance under conditions of acute hyperglycaemia.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-003-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-003</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686913</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Metabolically unstable diabetes">
      <data key="d0">Metabolically unstable diabetes</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A state of diabetes characterized by metabolic instability, posing risks when combined with acute illness.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-003-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-003</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686913</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Treating Doctor">
      <data key="d0">Treating Doctor</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A healthcare professional responsible for periodically reviewing patients with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A healthcare professional who periodically reviews patients with diabetes regarding disease progression.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-004-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-004&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687160</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Unconditional Licence">
      <data key="d0">Unconditional Licence</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of licence that can be held by a person under certain conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of licence that may be held by a person under specific conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A driving licence that a person is not fit to hold if they have non-insulin treated diabetes mellitus and are using glucose-lowering agents other than insulin.&lt;SEP&gt;A driving licence that may be held by a person who is not fit due to insulin-treated diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-005&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-007&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687257</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Diabetes Mellitus">
      <data key="d0">Diabetes Mellitus</data>
      <data key="d1">condition</data>
      <data key="d2">A medical condition characterized by high blood sugar levels, specifically non-insulin treated forms.&lt;SEP&gt;A chronic condition subject to the standards in the chapter.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-010-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-005&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-010</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686975</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Glucose-Lowering Agents">
      <data key="d0">Glucose-Lowering Agents</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Medication or substances used to lower blood glucose levels in patients with diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-005-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-005</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686921</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Conditional Licence">
      <data key="d0">Conditional Licence</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A driving permit that may be granted subject to annual review, considering the nature of the driving task and medical information.&lt;SEP&gt;A driving licence considered by the driver licensing authority subject to at least annual review based on specific medical criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of licence granted by the driver licensing authority that takes into account both the nature of the driving task and the medical condition.&lt;SEP&gt;A driving licence subject to at least annual review by the driver licensing authority.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-b0eadba676188c7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-b0eadba676188c7b&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687257</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Driver Licensing Authority">
      <data key="d0">Driver Licensing Authority</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The body responsible for reviewing conditional licences based on medical criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;The governmental or institutional body responsible for issuing conditional licences based on medical advice.&lt;SEP&gt;The entity responsible for issuing, renewing, suspending, or cancelling a person's driver licence, including conditional licences.&lt;SEP&gt;The body responsible for considering conditional licences and reviewing driver fitness.&lt;SEP&gt;The body responsible for granting conditional licences and considering the nature of driving tasks alongside medical conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The body responsible for considering conditional licences and reviewing them annually.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-075c415b489fe411-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-b0eadba676188c7b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-009&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-075c415b489fe411&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-b0eadba676188c7b&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687257</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Endocrinologist">
      <data key="d0">Endocrinologist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A physician specialising in diabetes who provides information regarding hypoglycaemia risks.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical specialist who provides information regarding diabetes treatment and hypoglycaemia risk assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical specialist who specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of disorders related to hormones and metabolism, including diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A specialist physician who provides information on diabetes criteria for conditional licence consideration.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical specialists who focus on disorders of the endocrine system, including diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical specialist who provides information regarding diabetes to the driver licensing authority.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-758d10f29d7875e9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-008&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-009&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-758d10f29d7875e9&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687257</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Consultant Physician">
      <data key="d0">Consultant Physician</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A medical specialist who assesses the nature of the driving task and hypoglycaemic history.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686937</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Hypoglycaemia Awareness">
      <data key="d0">Hypoglycaemia Awareness</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The experience of early warning symptoms of low blood sugar in the person.&lt;SEP&gt;The level of awareness regarding symptoms associated with low blood sugar levels.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-457570d561f8a4dd-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-457570d561f8a4dd</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687180</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Treatment Regimen">
      <data key="d0">Treatment Regimen</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A medical plan designed to minimise the risk of hypoglycaemia.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical plan designed to minimise the risk of hypoglycaemia in drivers with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical plan designed to minimize the risk of hypoglycaemia in persons with diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687257</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Commercial Driver">
      <data key="d0">Commercial Driver</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A driver with type 2 diabetes treated with metformin alone who may undergo annual reviews by their treating doctor.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686937</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Metformin">
      <data key="d0">Metformin</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A medication used to treat type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A medication used to treat type 2 diabetes, where annual reviews for commercial drivers can be undertaken by the treating doctor alone under specific conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A medication used to manage type 2 diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-758d10f29d7875e9-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-006&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-758d10f29d7875e9</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687210</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Insulin-treated diabetes">
      <data key="d0">Insulin-treated diabetes</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A medical condition characterized by diabetes management involving insulin, excluding gestational diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686955</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Gestational diabetes">
      <data key="d0">Gestational diabetes</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A form of diabetes that occurs during pregnancy and is excluded from the scope of insulin-treated diabetes in this context.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686955</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Driver licensing authority">
      <data key="d0">Driver licensing authority</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The governmental body responsible for issuing licenses to drivers and evaluating conditional licenses.&lt;SEP&gt;Government bodies responsible for issuing and managing driving licenses, including conditional ones.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-758d10f29d7875e9-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-758d10f29d7875e9</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687210</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Consultant physician specialising in diabetes">
      <data key="d0">Consultant physician specialising in diabetes</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A medical professional with expertise in diabetes who evaluates the criteria for granting a conditional driving license.&lt;SEP&gt;Senior medical doctors with expertise specifically in the diagnosis and management of diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-758d10f29d7875e9-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-758d10f29d7875e9</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687210</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Severe hypoglycaemic event">
      <data key="d0">Severe hypoglycaemic event</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A serious low blood sugar episode that must not have occurred within the last six weeks to qualify for a conditional license.&lt;SEP&gt;A distinct form of hypoglycaemia distinguished from mild events by its severity.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-0f4bda9270b6616d-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-0f4bda9270b6616d</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687005</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Treatment regimen">
      <data key="d0">Treatment regimen</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A medical plan designed to minimize the risk of hypoglycaemia in patients with insulin-treated diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686955</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Early warning symptoms">
      <data key="d0">Early warning symptoms</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Awareness of hypoglycaemia that allows a person to recognize and respond to low blood sugar levels before they become severe.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686955</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="End-organ effects">
      <data key="d0">End-organ effects</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Physical impacts on organs that could potentially affect the ability of a person to drive safely.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-008</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686955</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Conditional Licences">
      <data key="d0">Conditional Licences</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Licenses issued to commercial vehicle drivers that require periodic review by medical specialists to determine ongoing fitness to drive.&lt;SEP&gt;Licenses granted with specific conditions, subject to specific medical requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-447db3eceadb42ab-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-009&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-447db3eceadb42ab</data>
      <data key="d5">1792687172</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Commercial Vehicle Drivers">
      <data key="d0">Commercial Vehicle Drivers</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Individuals who operate commercial vehicles and are subject to specific licensing requirements regarding medical fitness.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-009-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-009</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686967</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Medical Specialist">
      <data key="d0">Medical Specialist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A qualified professional, such as an endocrinologist or consultant physician specializing in diabetes, who provides advice on driver fitness.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-009-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">AFTD2022-DM-COM-009</data>
      <data key="d5">1792686967</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Consultant Physician Specialising in Diabetes">
      <data key="d0">Consultant Physician Specialising in Diabetes</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A physician with expertise specifically in managing diabetes, capable of assessing a driver's medical fitness.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical specialist who assesses the nature of driving tasks and hypoglycaemia risks for drivers with diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical professional who assesses whether specific criteria are met for a person with insulin-treated diabetes.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-DM-COM-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e3ca8efaf3d71461-chunk-000</data>
