    <edge source="Person" target="Severe Hypoglycaemic Event">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A severe hypoglycaemic event can affect a person's ability to drive.&lt;SEP&gt;A severe hypoglycaemic event necessitates that a person refrain from driving for a significant period and undergo urgent medical assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;A severe hypoglycaemic event requires a person to not drive for a significant period and undergo urgent medical assessment.</data>
      <data key="d9">assessment,driving ban,driving hazard,medical event,restriction,safety</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-DM-COM-001&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-002&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-fbc891254df13760</data>
      <data key="d12">1792687114</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Person" target="Unconditional Licence">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A person is not considered fit to hold an unconditional licence if they meet specific medical criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;A person is not considered fit to hold an unconditional licence if they have insulin-treated diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;A person is not fit to hold an unconditional licence if they have non-insulin treated diabetes mellitus and are using glucose-lowering agents other than insulin.</data>
      <data key="d9">eligibility,fitness,medical assessment,medical restriction,restriction</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-DM-COM-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-DM-COM-005&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-DM-COM-007&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-42507db0424f7a27</data>
