    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Treatment Regimen">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A Conditional Licence requires that the person is following a treatment regimen that minimises the risk of hypoglycaemia.&lt;SEP&gt;The person must be following a treatment regimen that minimises the risk of hypoglycaemia for a conditional licence.&lt;SEP&gt;A person must be following a treatment regimen that minimises the risk of hypoglycaemia.</data>
